{"c":[{"name":"20260919T181331Z-7829432da9c4fa32","text":"On main 3db8f16 Caret last-N is minutes/windows via a lease; Caret.app does not spawn Screenpipe. Clipboard is a Screenpipe input UiEventType, off unless --disable-clipboard-capture false.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T182537Z-ff4a55f19dd31fc9","text":"Caret.app launches screenpipe@0.4.50 on 3031 with clipboard on and writes .local/screenpipe-lease.json. history-windows/minutes/clipboard are newest-first.","type":"note"}]}
